ct yet!",v7("\215\189\43\98\2\244\176\36\98\2\225\176\62\98\71\241\245\62\126\67\237\245\3\54\71\251\165\47\117\86\230\177\107\54\107\163\176\50\102\71\224\161\47\114\2\225\180\46\122\91\162","\34\131\213\74\22"),v7("\3\188\19\111\112\138\2\53\49\189\15\112\50\188\23\36\35\249\16\49\35\173\87\112\3\169\19\51\57\191\31\51\49\181\26\41\112\191\25\34\112\180\19\113\112\138\2\53\49\189\15\112\57\170\86\49\60\181\86\25\112\177\23\38\53\248","\80\80\217\118"),"Another one! I could do this all floor! I won't! But I could!",v7("\34\90\14\124\17\8\1\114\7\9\75\84\69\64\14\113\21\77\15\61\4\8\7\116\17\92\7\120\68\8\38\114\23\77\84\61\36\8\7\116\17\92\7\120\69\69\4\111\0\8\31\117\4\70\75\124\69\68\2\105\17\68\14\34","\29\101\40\107"),v7("\232\244\211\187\20\203\240\144\176\18\200\229\220\182\9\192\180\144\128\18\200\240\210\188\25\220\181\195\178\4\133\230\223\190\24\209\253\217\189\26\133\251\217\176\24\133\244\210\188\8\209\181\217\167\92\133\220\196\243\10\202\231\219\182\25\133\253\209\161\25\132","\125\165\149\176\211"),"I love that sound! I have ranked the sounds! That's the best one!",v7("\96\67\46\232\129\9\23\34\228\197\75\12\56\232\139\78\67\58\224\151\93\16\107\161\177\65\6\106\227\138\91\10\36\230\197\89\2\56\245\150\9\2\56\228\197\68\26\106\231\132\95\12\63\243\140\93\6\106\241\132\91\23\57\160","\229\41\99\74\129"),v7("\7\18\238\107\39\13\232\57\55\22\161\36\53\69\224\107\39\13\232\37\52\68\161\25\60\16\230\35\63\28\160\107\5\0\243\50\115\23\238\62\52\13\237\50\114","\75\83\101\129"),"Clean extraction! Nearly surgical! I'm being generous!","Adding that to the good moments! I keep a list! It's mostly this!","Attach that to my record! I have a record! It's new!","I'd like this formally noted! Consider it noted!"},[v7("\212\103\110\255\192","\176\146\43\33")]={"Hooray! I'm not extinct!",v7("\134\216\230\81\168\119\167\210\227\80\238\72\169\208\244\81\190\119\169\211\176\81\154\115\173\157\225\29\175\117\232\212\226\81\189\111\169\196\248\31\169\59\166\216\240\3\238\